From 3f5b69c2b2db7e8feef4d4d88a8d44aefc524c5c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ditternation <ditternation@localhost>
Date: Tue, 23 Jun 2026 00:56:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Avoid unsupported AIDL HAL probes

One UI 9 framework code probes AIDL audio and graphics services before
falling back to legacy HIDL HALs. Exynos2100 vendor does not implement
those AIDL HALs, so the probes produce repeated servicemanager VINTF misses.
Use the HIDL audio fallback directly and keep Watchdog from monitoring AIDL
audio/graphics interfaces that are intentionally absent on this target.
---
 smali/com/android/server/Watchdog.smali           | 42 +++++++++--------------
 smali/com/android/server/audio/AudioService.smali | 13 -------
 2 files changed, 16 insertions(+), 39 deletions(-)

